    "model": {
        "accumulator": "int32, worst case 33*3*127",
        "alpha": 0.5,
        "alphabet": 35,
        "artifact": "serialized in memory only; no model file is written",
        "formatVersion": 1,
        "formula": "For language L and keys k1..kn, sequence BOS BOS k1..kn EOS. For each predicted symbol c with context (a,b): Q_L = sum over orders of w_n * round(8 * ln P_n), P_1(c) = (N(c)+0.5)/(N+35*0.5), P_2(c|b) = (N(b,c)+0.5)/(N(b)+35*0.5), P_3(c|a,b) = (N(a,b,c)+0.5)/(N(a,b)+35*0.5), each clamped to [-127,0]; w = (1,1,1). S_L = sum Q_L / (8 * (n+1)). S_L is a weighted log-score, not a calibrated probability.",
        "scale": 8,
        "serializationRoundTrip": true,
        "shortTokenPolicy": "tokens with fewer than 4 keys always abstain in n-gram and exact policies",
        "skippedTrainingSequences": 0,
        "trainingTypesEn": 34025,
        "trainingTypesRu": 97632
    },
